1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Aired up the tire and the light
is still on?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Most systems need a short drive
to recheck all four sensors.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
A few minutes above ~15 mph.
Check every tire, not just one.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Still lit after that? May be
a sensor, not just pressure.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Worth checking if it lingers.
Stop by and we'll take a look.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Nick's Tire & Auto
